+//
+// SiegeLadder D10 step 1 (docs/v41/d10-design.md; models/deepseek4.cpp, build_attention_impl): D11's sparse attention in
+// prefill, on the chunks above. Every query of a compressed layer attends only over the indexer's picks and its window,
+// gathered per query, instead of over the window ring and every compressed position with a top-k mask.
+//   LLAMA_DSV4_SPARSE_PREFILL=1  on (0 = off, the default)
+//   LLAMA_DSV4_SPARSE_QC=n       queries per chunk (default 512): the gathered K is 768 KiB per query, 384 MiB per chunk
